    {"step": 3, "tactic": "Scoped recording via test-app HTTP debug API on localhost:9100", "technique": "T1056.002", "what_happened": "At 2031-08-26 14:08:18, Sysmon EID 3 captured outbound HTTP from powershell.exe to localhost:9100/debug/record/start?duration=5 with UA 'CorpUAT-Recorder/2.4'. 5 seconds later: 'localhost:9100/debug/record/stop'. NO SetWindowsHookEx call, NO CredUIPromptForCredentialsW import, NO user32.dll / credui.dll load into powershell.exe.", "chain_reason": "The recording is delegated to the test-app's OWN HTTP debug API on localhost:9100. The test-app, not the script, captures input — and only WITHIN the test-app's process. No global keyboard hook, no fake credential dialog."},
